  "title": "Opinion decision matrix",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Opinion decision matrix</h2><p>Determine the ordinarily appropriate opinion for each independent scenario.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m4-tbs1-f1\">Opinion for A</label><select id=\"aud-m4-tbs1-f1\"><option value=\"Unmodified\">Unmodified</option><option value=\"Qualified\">Qualified</option><option value=\"Adverse\">Adverse</option><option value=\"Disclaimer\">Disclaimer</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m4-tbs1-f2\">Opinion for B</label><select id=\"aud-m4-tbs1-f2\"><option value=\"Unmodified\">Unmodified</option><option value=\"Qualified\">Qualified</option><option value=\"Adverse\">Adverse</option><option value=\"Disclaimer\">Disclaimer</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m4-tbs1-f3\">Opinion for C</label><select id=\"aud-m4-tbs1-f3\"><option value=\"Unmodified\">Unmodified</option><option value=\"Qualified\">Qualified</option><option value=\"Adverse\">Adverse</option><option value=\"Disclaimer\">Disclaimer</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m4-tbs1-f4\">Opinion for D</label><select id=\"aud-m4-tbs1-f4\"><option value=\"Unmodified\">Unmodified</option><option value=\"Qualified\">Qualified</option><option value=\"Adverse\">Adverse</option><option value=\"Disclaimer\">Disclaimer</option></select></div></section>",
